config FINGERPRINT_GOODIX_GF3208
	tristate "Goodix GF3208 fingerprint driver support"
	depends on GPIOLIB && OF && NET
	depends on DRM || !DRM
	help
	  Say Y here to enable support for the Goodix GF3208 fingerprint
	  sensor as found on Xiaomi MSM8953 devices. It provides
	  /dev/goodix_fp and a netlink socket for the vendor fingerprint HAL,
	  which talks to the sensor through TrustZone.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	  be called goodix_fp.
